{
  "ja281:1.1": "The Abbhantara mango tree, ",
  "ja281:1.2": "which has a fruit that is divine, ",
  "ja281:1.3": "Eating it the pregnant woman ",
  "ja281:1.4": "gives birth to a Universal Monarch. ",
  "ja281:2.1": "Lady, you are a great queen, ",
  "ja281:2.2": "also you are dear to your husband, ",
  "ja281:2.3": "The king will (surely) bring ",
  "ja281:2.4": "the Abbhantara (mango) fruit to you. ",
  "ja281:3.1": "Exerting for the master’s sake, ",
  "ja281:3.2": "whatever position he attains, ",
  "ja281:3.3": "The self-sacrificing hero, ",
  "ja281:3.4": "I am the one receiving (it). "
}
